{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model combining pca_n2000 RNA encoding with imagenet_vit_l image features using avgpool aggregation and concat fusion, building on the RNA-only baseline (config_005). Validation accuracy (0.6287) and F1 (0.5993) are lower than the RNA-only baseline (0.6501), suggesting multimodal integration may not improve performance in this configuration. The exact impact of image data, fusion strategy, or encoder compatibility remains uncertain without direct comparisons to alternative image encoders or fusion methods."
}

